@startuml
' Windowing / overlap / hop illustration
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
title Windowing: win_s, overlap, hop_s = win_s(1 − overlap)

participant "Signal (samples)" as S

== Window #1 ==
activate S
note over S #e8f0fe
  Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate S

... hop_s = win_s × (1 − overlap) ...

== Window #2 ==
activate S
note over S #e8f0fe
  Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate S

note over S
  Example: win_s = 5 s, overlap = 0.8 → hop_s = 1.0 s
end note

@enduml
